# --- Data. Never commit. ---
# The pipeline's working data lives outside this repo (see pipeline/README.md).
# On the machine it was developed on that is /media/alex/T5Red/DT-data/, roughly
# 99 GB of datasets, COLMAP workspaces and nerfstudio outputs, plus ~38 GB of
# archived runs. These patterns exist so a stray copy inside the repo cannot be
# staged by accident.
datasets/
colmap/
outputs/
archive-*/
supersplat/
masked-images/
experiments/*/data/
weights/
*.ply
*.splat
*.ckpt

# --- IDE and Python cruft ---
.idea/
.vscode/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
